"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "Batas kecepatan, sambungan saben torrent, slot unggah lan seeding ditetepake kanggo saben torrent nalika sampeyan nambahake, utawa sabanjuré ing ngisor Setelan Torrent. Torrent nggunakake proksi saka tab Sambungan (HTTP utawa SOCKS5, utawa proksi Mac karo \"Gunakake setelan sistem\") lan wates kecepatan kanggo kabeh muter-muter. Perubahané ditrapake kanggo torrent kang diwiwiti sawisé iku. Peers lan trackers bisa ndeleng alamat IP sampeyan, utawa proksi sampeyan.";
"Settings used for every download from a website. A site also covers its subdomains (example.com covers www.example.com). Logins are only sent to that site and are kept with the app's other secrets." = "Pangaturan kang digunakaké kanggo saben ngunduh saka situs web. Sawijining situs uga nglindhungi subdomain-é (example.com nglindhungi www.example.com). Log in mung dikirim menyang situs mau lan disimpen karo rahasia liyane saka aplikasi.";
"A backup holds your settings, site settings, queues and the downloads list. Passwords and cookies are never put in a backup." = "Salinan cadangan ngandhut setelan, setelan situs, gulungan, lan dhaptar ngundhuh. Sandi lan kuki ora tau disimpen ing salinan cadangan.";
